Method 2: Ternary Operator

Most commonly used in React.

Syntax

condition ? True : False

Example

function App() {

const isLoggedIn = false;

return (

<h1>

{isLoggedIn ? "Welcome" : "Please Login"}

</h1>

);

}
Line-by-Line Explanation
{ }

Inside JSX, curly braces let you write JavaScript expressions.

isLoggedIn ?

If true...

"Welcome"

Show this.

:

Otherwise...

"Please Login"

Show this.

Output

