If

cartCount = 4

Output

4

If

0

Nothing appears.

Method 4: Returning null

React allows a component to render nothing.

function Welcome({ show }) {

if (!show) {

return null;

}

return <h2>Hello User</h2>;

}

If

show=false

Nothing renders.

This is useful for:

Hidden popup
Tooltip
Modal
Notification
Loading state



