8. Common Mistakes
❌ Mistake 1: Using if directly inside JSX
return (
  <div>
    if (isLoggedIn) {
      <h1>Welcome</h1>
    }
  </div>
);

✅ Correct:

return (
  <div>
    {isLoggedIn ? <h1>Welcome</h1> : <h1>Please Login</h1>}
  </div>
);


❌ Mistake 2: Forgetting curly braces

Wrong:

<h1>isLoggedIn ? "Welcome" : "Login"</h1>

Correct:

<h1>{isLoggedIn ? "Welcome" : "Login"}</h1>




condition1
  ? condition2
    ? "A"
    : "B"
  : condition3
    ? "C"
    : "D";



Instead:

if (condition1) {
  // ...
} else {
  // ...
}


